
STEP 1: CHECK DOCKER VERSION

docker --version


STEP 2: CHECK EXISTING DOCKER IMAGE

docker images


STEP 3: LOGIN TO DOCKER HUB

docker login


STEP 4: TAG THE EXISTING IMAGE

docker tag my-python-app monika035/my-python-app:v1


STEP 5: CHECK THE TAGGED IMAGE

docker images


STEP 6: PUSH THE IMAGE TO DOCKER HUB

docker push monika035/my-python-app:v1


STEP 7: FINAL DOCKER HUB IMAGE

monika035/my-python-app:v1


